-module__Uf2pWa__mask"><span style="transform:translateY(100%)">of</span></span> </span><span><span class="styledesc-module-scss-module__Uf2pWa__mask"><span style="transform:translateY(100%)">technology.</span></span> </span></p></div></div><section class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__experience" id="experience"><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__sectionHeader" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)"><p class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__subtitle">Where I've worked</p><h2 class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__sectionTitle">Work <br/>Experience</h2></div><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__timeline"><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__timelineItem" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px) translateY(20px)"><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__markerColumn"><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__markerWrapper"><img alt="Google For Developers On Campus" class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__markerIcon" src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/google/google-original.svg"/></div><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__connectorLine"></div></div><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__contentCard"><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__cardHeader"><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__headerLeft"><h3 class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__role">Event Scape</h3><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__separator">·</span><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__company">Google For Developers On Campus</span></div><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__duration">Sept 2024 - Oct 2025</span></div><p class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__description">Organized and managed large-scale technical events and workshops at GDG on Campus. Coordinated cross-functional teams, secured logistics, and facilitated speaker sessions to deliver impactful, hands-on learning experiences for over 500 engineering students in the local developer community, focusing on AI and full-stack development.</p><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__tags"></div></div></div><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__timelineItem" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px) translateY(20px)"><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__markerColumn"><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__markerWrapper"><img alt="Guru Shishya Publication" class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__markerIcon" src="/images/author-logo.jpeg"/></div><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__connectorLine"></div></div><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__contentCard"><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__cardHeader"><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__headerLeft"><h3 class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__role">Author</h3><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__separator">·</span><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__company">Guru Shishya Publication</span></div><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__duration">Sept 2024 - Nov 2025</span></div><p class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__description">Authored and published four comprehensive technical textbooks covering IoT, Computer Architecture, C Programming, and Object-Oriented Programming using Java. Handled end-to-end manuscript creation, technical diagram design, and structural formatting to break down complex computer science concepts into accessible, student-friendly curriculum materials used in university courses.</p><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__tags"><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__tag">Computer Architecture</span><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__tag">Java</span><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__tag">IOT</span><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__tag">C Programming</span></div></div></div><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__timelineItem" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px) translateY(20px)"><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__markerColumn"><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__markerWrapper"><img alt="Edunet Foundation (VI)" class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__markerIcon" src="/images/vi.png"/></div></div><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__contentCard"><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__cardHeader"><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__headerLeft"><h3 class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__role">Cyber Security intern</h3><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__separator">·</span><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__company">Edunet Foundation (VI)</span></div><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__duration">Mar 2026 – Apr 2026</span></div><p class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__description">Gained practical, hands-on exposure to advanced Cyber Security concepts and offensive security techniques. Conducted ethical hacking exercises, network vulnerability scanning, and forensic packet analysis using industry-standard tools like Kali Linux, Wireshark, and Nmap. Documented phishing simulation attacks and compiled comprehensive vulnerability assessment reports for internal review.</p><div class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__tags"><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__tag">Kali Linux</span><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__tag">Wireshark</span><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__tag">Nmap</span><span class="experience-module-scss-module__eaVIHa__tag">Network Security</span></div></div></div></div></section><main class="style-module-scss-module__zNrq5a__projects" id="projects"><div class="style-module-scss-module__zNrq5a__sectionHeader" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)"><p class="style-module-scss-module__zNrq5a__subtitle">What I've built</p><h2 class="style-module-scss-module__zNrq5a__sectionTitle">Featured <br/>Projects</h2></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__zNrq5a__body"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__projectContainer"><button aria-controls="panel-gotrip" aria-expanded="false" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__project"><h2>GoTrip</h2><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__rightSide"><p>AI Travel Tech</p><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__indicator">+</span></div></button><div aria-hidden="true" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__panelWrapper" id="panel-gotrip" role="region"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__panelContent"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__caseStudy"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csHeader"><div><h3 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csTitle">GoTrip</h3><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csTagline">AI-powered travel companion and itinerary planner.</p></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csHeaderRight"><a class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__btnPrimary" href="https://mygotrip.vercel.app/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Live Demo</a><a class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__btnGhost" href="https://github.com/Kushagrawal1903" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">GitHub Repo</a><a class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__btnGhost" href="/projects/gotrip">More Details</a></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csGalleryTop"><img alt="GoTrip screenshot 1" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__galleryImage" src="/images/gotrip1.png"/><img alt="GoTrip screenshot 2" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__galleryImage" src="/images/gotrip2.png"/></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csMetrics"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricCard"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricValue">4+</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricLabel">APIs Integrated</span></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricCard"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricValue">&lt;1.2s</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricLabel">Load Time</span></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricCard"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricValue">15K+</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricLabel">Lines of Code</span></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csMainGrid"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csColLeft"><section><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Project Overview</h4><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csText">GoTrip is an intelligent, end-to-end travel platform that utilizes generative AI to curate highly personalized travel itineraries, simplifying the booking and planning process for modern travelers.</p><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">The Problem</h4><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csText">Travelers spend an average of 10+ hours researching destinations, cross-referencing reviews, and building disjointed itineraries across multiple apps. GoTrip was built to unify this process into a single, seamless, AI-driven experience.</p></section><section><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Key Features</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featuresList"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureCard"><h5 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureTitle">Smart Itinerary Generation</h5><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureDesc">AI instantly creates day-by-day plans based on user preferences, budget, and travel dates.</p></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureCard"><h5 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureTitle">Seamless Booking Integration</h5><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureDesc">Aggregated booking flows for flights, hotels, and local experiences.</p></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureCard"><h5 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureTitle">Real-time Collaboration</h5><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureDesc">Allows groups to co-edit and vote on travel plans synchronously.</p></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureCard"><h5 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureTitle">Dynamic Budget Tracker</h5><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureDesc">Visualized expense tracking to ensure trips stay within budget limits.</p></div></div></section><section><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Engineering Challenges</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengesList"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengeCard"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengeBox"><strong>Challenge:</strong> <!-- -->High latency in AI generation</div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__solutionBox"><strong>Solution:</strong> <!-- -->Implemented streaming responses and background processing via WebSockets to provide immediate UI feedback while the full itinerary computes.</div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengeCard"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengeBox"><strong>Challenge:</strong> <!-- -->Complex state management for collaborative editing</div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__solutionBox"><strong>Solution:</strong> <!-- -->Utilized Redis for real-time pub/sub synchronization and optimized Redux for local state reconciliation.</div></div></div></section></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csColRight"><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Project Details</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__detailsRow"><span>Role:</span> <strong>Full Stack Developer &amp; AI Integrator</strong></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__detailsRow"><span>Timeline:</span> <strong>Jan 2026 - Present</strong></div></section><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Architecture &amp; Tech Stack</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__architectureList"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archRow"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archCategory">Frontend</span><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archTags"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">React</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Next.js</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Tailwind CSS</span></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archRow"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archCategory">Backend</span><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archTags"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Node.js</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Express</span></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archRow"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archCategory">Database</span><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archTags"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">MongoDB</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Redis (Caching)</span></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archRow"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archCategory">AI &amp; APIs</span><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archTags"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">OpenAI API</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Google Maps API</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Amadeus API</span></div></div></div></section><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Key Learnings</h4><ul class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__learningsList"><li>Mastered streaming AI responses for improved perceived performance.</li><li>Gained deep understanding of scalable NoSQL schema design.</li><li>Learned to manage complex API orchestrations with fault tolerance.</li></ul></section><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Future Roadmap</h4><ul class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__roadmapList"><li>Mobile app release via React Native.</li><li>Integration with more regional flight providers.</li><li>Automated split-payment functionality for groups.</li></ul></section></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__projectContainer"><button aria-controls="panel-blinkit" aria-expanded="false" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__project"><h2>Blinkit Dashboard</h2><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__rightSide"><p>Data Analytics</p><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__indicator">+</span></div></button><div aria-hidden="true" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__panelWrapper" id="panel-blinkit" role="region"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__panelContent"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__caseStudy"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csHeader"><div><h3 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csTitle">Blinkit Dashboard</h3><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csTagline">Strategic quick-commerce performance analytics.</p></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csHeaderRight"><a class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__btnPrimary" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-3ntmD1HYYivZJsy_893srrSoGycTwhB/view?usp=sharing" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">View Dashboard</a><a class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__btnGhost" href="/projects/blinkit">More Details</a></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csGalleryTop"><img alt="Blinkit Dashboard screenshot 1" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__galleryImage" src="/images/blinkit1.jpg"/><img alt="Blinkit Dashboard screenshot 2" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__galleryImage" src="/images/blinkit2.jpg"/></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csMetrics"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricCard"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricValue">2M+</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricLabel">Data Rows Processed</span></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricCard"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricValue">12</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricLabel">Visuals Created</span></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricCard"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricValue">3 Key Actionables</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricLabel">Insights Generated</span></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricCard"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricValue">7 Weeks</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricLabel">Development Time</span></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csMainGrid"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csColLeft"><section><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Project Overview</h4><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csText">A comprehensive Business Intelligence dashboard designed to visualize and track key quick-commerce metrics. It enables operational teams to identify bottlenecks in delivery times and inventory turnover.</p><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">The Problem</h4><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csText">Quick-commerce relies on sub-10-minute deliveries. Raw data logs were too massive to parse manually, leading to delayed decisions on warehouse staffing and inventory restocks. This dashboard brings real-time clarity to operational health.</p></section><section><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Key Features</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featuresList"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureCard"><h5 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureTitle">Delivery Time Analytics</h5><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureDesc">Granular breakdown of order-to-delivery timelines across various dark stores.</p></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureCard"><h5 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureTitle">Inventory Turnover Tracking</h5><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureDesc">Highlights fast-moving vs. stagnant inventory.</p></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureCard"><h5 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureTitle">Heatmaps</h5><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureDesc">Geospatial visualization of high-demand areas.</p></div></div></section><section><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Engineering Challenges</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengesList"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengeCard"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengeBox"><strong>Challenge:</strong> <!-- -->Processing millions of raw order rows efficiently</div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__solutionBox"><strong>Solution:</strong> <!-- -->Built Python scripts for pre-aggregation and utilized DAX optimizations to ensure Power BI visual renderings remained under 3 seconds.</div></div></div></section></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csColRight"><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Project Details</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__detailsRow"><span>Role:</span> <strong>Data Analyst</strong></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__detailsRow"><span>Timeline:</span> <strong>Nov 2025 - Dec 2025</strong></div></section><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Architecture &amp; Tech Stack</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__architectureList"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archRow"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archCategory">Data Processing</span><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archTags"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Python</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Pandas</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">NumPy</span></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archRow"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archCategory">Visualization</span><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archTags"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Power BI</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">DAX</span></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archRow"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archCategory">Storage</span><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archTags"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Excel</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">CSV</span></div></div></div></section><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Key Learnings</h4><ul class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__learningsList"><li>Advanced DAX scripting for complex time-intelligence queries.</li><li>Data storytelling techniques to highlight actionable KPIs rather than just vanity metrics.</li></ul></section><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Future Roadmap</h4><ul class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__roadmapList"><li>Automate data pipelines using Apache Airflow.</li><li>Integrate predictive models for demand forecasting.</li></ul></section></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__projectContainer"><button aria-controls="panel-hr-analytics" aria-expanded="false" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__project"><h2>HR Analytics</h2><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__rightSide"><p>Data Analytics</p><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__indicator">+</span></div></button><div aria-hidden="true" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__panelWrapper" id="panel-hr-analytics" role="region"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__panelContent"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__caseStudy"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csHeader"><div><h3 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csTitle">HR Analytics</h3><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csTagline">Predictive insights into workforce health and retention.</p></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csHeaderRight"><a class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__btnPrimary" href="https://github.com/Kushagrawal1903" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">GitHub Repo</a><a class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__btnGhost" href="/projects/hr-analytics">More Details</a></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csGalleryTop"><img alt="HR Analytics screenshot 1" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__galleryImage" src="/images/hr1.png"/><img alt="HR Analytics screenshot 2" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__galleryImage" src="/images/hr2.png"/></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csMetrics"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricCard"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricValue">84%</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricLabel">Accuracy of Flags</span></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricCard"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricValue">5</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricLabel">Datasets Merged</span></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricCard"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricValue">3 Weeks</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricLabel">Development Time</span></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csMainGrid"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csColLeft"><section><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Project Overview</h4><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csText">A sophisticated analytics solution focused on human resource metrics. It provides leadership with a strategic overview of employee satisfaction, attrition risks, and diversity metrics through interactive visualizations.</p><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">The Problem</h4><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csText">High employee turnover is costly. Organizations often realize employees are dissatisfied only after they resign. This tool was built to identify pre-resignation patterns and help HR take proactive retention measures.</p></section><section><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Key Features</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featuresList"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureCard"><h5 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureTitle">Attrition Predictor</h5><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureDesc">Uses historical data to flag departments or roles with high flight risks.</p></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureCard"><h5 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureTitle">Demographic Insights</h5><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureDesc">Tracks diversity and inclusion metrics across the organizational hierarchy.</p></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureCard"><h5 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureTitle">Performance vs. Pay Analysis</h5><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureDesc">Identifies compensation anomalies.</p></div></div></section><section><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Engineering Challenges</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengesList"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengeCard"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengeBox"><strong>Challenge:</strong> <!-- -->Handling sparse and inconsistent historical HR data</div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__solutionBox"><strong>Solution:</strong> <!-- -->Implemented rigorous data cleaning pipelines in Python, utilizing mean imputation and SMOTE for balancing attrition classes.</div></div></div></section></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csColRight"><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Project Details</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__detailsRow"><span>Role:</span> <strong>Data Analyst &amp; Engineer</strong></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__detailsRow"><span>Timeline:</span> <strong>Aug 2025 - Aug 2025</strong></div></section><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Architecture &amp; Tech Stack</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__architectureList"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archRow"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archCategory">Analysis</span><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archTags"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Python</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Jupyter</span></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archRow"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archCategory">Visualization</span><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archTags"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Tableau</span></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archRow"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archCategory">Database</span><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archTags"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">SQL</span></div></div></div></section><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Key Learnings</h4><ul class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__learningsList"><li>Deepened expertise in SQL window functions.</li><li>Learned best practices for designing Tableau dashboards tailored for executive audiences.</li></ul></section><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Future Roadmap</h4><ul class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__roadmapList"><li>Incorporate real-time employee survey data via API.</li><li>Develop a natural language query interface for HR managers.</li></ul></section></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__projectContainer"><button aria-controls="panel-snapverse" aria-expanded="false" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__project"><h2>SnapVerse</h2><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__rightSide"><p>React &amp; Node.js</p><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__indicator">+</span></div></button><div aria-hidden="true" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__panelWrapper" id="panel-snapverse" role="region"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__panelContent"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__caseStudy"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csHeader"><div><h3 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csTitle">SnapVerse</h3><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csTagline">A real-time, community-driven social platform.</p></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csHeaderRight"><a class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__btnPrimary" href="https://snapverse-ai.vercel.app" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Live Demo</a><a class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__btnGhost" href="https://github.com/Kushagrawal1903" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">GitHub Repo</a><a class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__btnGhost" href="/projects/snapverse">More Details</a></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csGalleryTop"><img alt="SnapVerse screenshot 1" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__galleryImage" src="/images/snap1.png"/><img alt="SnapVerse screenshot 2" class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__galleryImage" src="/images/snap2.png"/></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csMetrics"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricCard"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricValue">Tested to 500+</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricLabel">Concurrent Users</span></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricCard"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricValue">95+</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricLabel">Lighthouse Score</span></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricCard"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricValue">6 Weeks</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__metricLabel">Development Time</span></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csMainGrid"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csColLeft"><section><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Project Overview</h4><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csText">SnapVerse is a modern, responsive social media application designed for seamless media sharing and real-time community interaction, featuring instant messaging and content moderation.</p><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">The Problem</h4><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csText">Many social platforms suffer from bloated UIs and slow real-time syncing. SnapVerse was created to demonstrate a highly optimized, mobile-first social experience with instantaneous chat and fluid media uploads.</p></section><section><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Key Features</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featuresList"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureCard"><h5 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureTitle">Real-time Messaging</h5><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureDesc">Instant, bi-directional chat using WebSockets.</p></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureCard"><h5 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureTitle">Infinite Scroll Feed</h5><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureDesc">Optimized media feed with lazy loading and virtualization.</p></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureCard"><h5 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureTitle">Secure Authentication</h5><p class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__featureDesc">JWT-based auth with robust security measures.</p></div></div></section><section><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Engineering Challenges</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengesList"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengeCard"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengeBox"><strong>Challenge:</strong> <!-- -->Memory leaks with WebSocket connections on component unmount</div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__solutionBox"><strong>Solution:</strong> <!-- -->Implemented strict cleanup routines in React useEffect hooks and managed socket instances via Context API.</div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengeCard"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__challengeBox"><strong>Challenge:</strong> <!-- -->Optimizing image loads</div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__solutionBox"><strong>Solution:</strong> <!-- -->Integrated a CDN and implemented image compression on upload.</div></div></div></section></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csColRight"><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Project Details</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__detailsRow"><span>Role:</span> <strong>Full Stack Developer</strong></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__detailsRow"><span>Timeline:</span> <strong>Feb 2026 - Apr 2026</strong></div></section><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Architecture &amp; Tech Stack</h4><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__architectureList"><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archRow"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archCategory">Frontend</span><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archTags"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">React</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Tailwind CSS</span></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archRow"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archCategory">Backend</span><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archTags"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Node.js</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Express</span><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">Socket.io</span></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archRow"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archCategory">Database</span><div class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__archTags"><span class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__techTag">MongoDB</span></div></div></div></section><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Key Learnings</h4><ul class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__learningsList"><li>Mastered real-time bidirectional communication with Socket.io.</li><li>Learned advanced React performance optimization techniques (useMemo, useCallback).</li></ul></section><section class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionBox"><h4 class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__csSectionTitle">Future Roadmap</h4><ul class="style-module-scss-module__g_CNKG__roadmapList"><li>Add AI-powered content moderation.</li><li>Implement video call capabilities via WebRTC.</li></ul></section></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><a href="/projects"><div class="styleroundedbutton-module-scss-module__bjPWDq__roundedButton" style="overflow:hidden"><p>View All Projects</p><div class="styleroundedbutton-module-scss-module__bjPWDq__circle" style="background-color:#455CE9"></div></div></a></main><section class="skills-module-scss-module__nO9BJq__skillsSection" id="skills"><div class="skills-module-scss-module__nO9BJq__bgNoise"></div><div class="skills-module-scss-module__nO9BJq__sectionHeader" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)"><p class="skills-module-scss-module__nO9BJq__subtitle">What I work with</p><h2 class="skills-module-scss-module__nO9BJq__sectionTitle">Skills &amp; <br/>Technologies</h2></div><div class="skills-module-scss-module__nO9BJq__skillsContainer" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><div class="skills-module-scss-module__nO9BJq__skillsGrid"><div class="skills-module-scss-module__nO9BJq__skillColumn"><div class="skills-module-scss-module__nO9BJq__columnHeader"><span class="skills-module-scss-module__nO9BJq__columnIndex">0<!-- -->1</span><h3 class="skills-module-scss-module__nO9BJq__columnTitle">Languages</h3><div class="skills-module-scss-module__nO9BJq__columnDivider"></div></div><div class="skills-module-scss-module__nO9BJq__columnCards"><div class="skills-module-scss-module__nO9BJq__skillCard" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px) sca